{"id":"287f5a015dc5ca38","group":"28","path":"28/28-prop-one-time-pad-key-reuse.md","title":"重复一次一密密钥泄露明文异或","display":"prop-one-time-pad-key-reuse — 重复一次一密密钥泄露明文异或","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-prop-one-time-pad-key-reuse","aliases":["28-prop-one-time-pad-key-reuse"],"display":"prop-one-time-pad-key-reuse — 重复一次一密密钥泄露明文异或","depends_on":["[[28-ex-one-time-pad]]","[[28-df-perfect-secrecy]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §9.1 key-reuse paragraph","source_printed_pages":"175","source_pdf_pages":"201","source_status":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-prop-one-time-pad-key-reuse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-prop-one-time-pad-key-reuse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-one-time-pad-key-reuse — 重复一次一密密钥泄露明文异或"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"94ded8b3ba316311\" href=\"?note=94ded8b3ba316311\" title=\"28-ex-one-time-pad\">28-ex-one-time-pad</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"05773b5ac46bc2b8\" href=\"?note=05773b5ac46bc2b8\" title=\"28-df-perfect-secrecy\">28-df-perfect-secrecy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §9.1 key-reuse paragraph"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"175"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"201"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,x,x&#39;,y,y&#39;\\in\\Sigma^n\">\\(k,x,x&#39;,y,y&#39;\\in\\Sigma^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OTP}_n\">\\(\\operatorname{OTP}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"94ded8b3ba316311\" href=\"?note=94ded8b3ba316311\" title=\"28-ex-one-time-pad\">28-ex-one-time-pad</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}\">\\(\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"05773b5ac46bc2b8\" href=\"?note=05773b5ac46bc2b8\" title=\"28-df-perfect-secrecy\">28-df-perfect-secrecy</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ReuseE}_n(k,(x,x&#39;))\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,x),\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,x&#39;)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ReuseE}_n(k,(x,x&#39;))\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,x),\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,x&#39;)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ReuseD}_n(k,(y,y&#39;))\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,y),\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,y&#39;)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ReuseD}_n(k,(y,y&#39;))\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,y),\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,y&#39;)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,x)\\oplus\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,x&#39;)=x\\oplus x&#39;.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,x)\\oplus\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,x&#39;)=x\\oplus x&#39;.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}(\\Sigma^n,\\Sigma^n\\times\\Sigma^n,\\Sigma^n\\times\\Sigma^n,\\operatorname{ReuseE}_n,\\operatorname{ReuseD}_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}(\\Sigma^n,\\Sigma^n\\times\\Sigma^n,\\Sigma^n\\times\\Sigma^n,\\operatorname{ReuseE}_n,\\operatorname{ReuseD}_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个相同k逐位相消，因此公开密文对确定明文异或。取明文对(0<sup>n,0</sup>n)与(0^n,e₁)，前者总产生相等的两个密文，后者总产生不同密文；两分布支持互斥，违背完美保密。n≥1保证e₁存在；n=0确实没有这种泄露反例。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§9.1 key-reuse paragraph；印刷 pp.175 / PDF pp.201。本次核对范围：原书对应陈述及本注内所列论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-ex-one-time-pad","status":"resolved","id":"94ded8b3ba316311","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-ex-one-time-pad]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-perfect-secrecy","status":"resolved","id":"05773b5ac46bc2b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-perfect-secrecy]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-ex-one-time-pad","status":"resolved","id":"94ded8b3ba316311","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$k,x,x',y,y'\\in\\Sigma^n$；$\\operatorname{OTP}_n$ 见 [[28-ex-one-time-pad]]；$\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}$ 见 [[28-df-perfect-secrecy]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-perfect-secrecy","status":"resolved","id":"05773b5ac46bc2b8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$k,x,x',y,y'\\in\\Sigma^n$；$\\operatorname{OTP}_n$ 见 [[28-ex-one-time-pad]]；$\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}$ 见 [[28-df-perfect-secrecy]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"k,x,x',y,y'\\in\\Sigma^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OTP}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ReuseE}_n(k,(x,x'))\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,x),\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,x')),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ReuseD}_n(k,(y,y'))\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,y),\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,y')).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,x)\\oplus\\operatorname{OTP}_n(k,x')=x\\oplus x'.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\operatorname{PerfectSecret}(\\Sigma^n,\\Sigma^n\\times\\Sigma^n,\\Sigma^n\\times\\Sigma^n,\\operatorname{ReuseE}_n,\\operatorname{ReuseD}_n).","display":true}],"bytes":1865,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-318","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-perfect-secrecy]]、[[28-ex-one-time-pad]]、[[28-thm-perfect-secrecy-key-bound]]、[[28-df-one-way-permutation]]、[[28-thm-ggm-prf]]、[[28-prop-one-time-pad-key-reuse]]。"}],"outgoing":["94ded8b3ba316311","05773b5ac46bc2b8"]}